Wraith corpses aren't guaranteed, even on non-graveyard levels; I'd
rather use more of the cursed-genocide scrolls for nurses. Nurse
dancing can take a long time and is somewhat dangerous, but often
worth the risk; my favorite place to do it is in the upper-left corner
room of Ludios. Don't forget alchemy also, as you can get both HP and
levels that way; quaffing a few blessed full healing is a lot quicker
than nurse dancing.

In any case, markers are always a good wish when you already have your
ascension kit, but definitely keep at least one non-wrest wish in
reserve for emergencies. I wouldn't waste marker charges on a
spellbook of dig unless you really have a lot to burn.

